db/
incremental_db/
output_files/
simulation/
greybox_tmp/
hc_output/
*.qws
*.rpt
*.summary
*.smsg
*.sof
*.pof
*.rbf
# ...EXCEPT the released one. releases/ is CHECKED IN on purpose: MiSTer's
# distribution system reads the parent MRAs, _alternatives/ and the RBF out of the
# repo to copy into the master distribution, so it is a deliverable and not a build
# product. `make release` refreshes it; the result has to be committed. Do not add
# releases/ back to this file.
!releases/*.rbf
*.jdi
*.pin
*.done
sim/obj_dir/

# `make release-zip` output. The zip is rebuildable from releases/, which IS
# checked in, so only the directory it lands in is ignored.
dist/

# Debugging debris, not sources.
# compile*.log: ~14 MB of Quartus transcripts from the hardware sessions.
# sim/*.ppm:    ~22 MB of rendered frames from tb_video / tb_boot.
# *.114:        side-by-side copies kept during the clk_ram experiment.
compile*.log
sim/*.ppm
sim/*.png
tools/__pycache__/
*.114

# Generated from MAME by tools/gen_ref_c.py; the Makefile rebuilds it.
sim/spi_ref.h

# Savestates. A .ss carries the 386's 256 KB of main RAM -- live game state --
# so it does not belong in a public repo. Keep them locally; PLAN.md 45 and 50
# describe the one this project debugged with.
*.ss
